      "source": "Also supports \"java.lang.String[]\"-style array class names, in contrast\nto the standard <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#forName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.forName(String)</code></a> method.",
      "translation": "此外还支持类似 \"java.lang.String[]\" 的数组类名，这与标准的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#forName(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.forName(String)</code></a> 方法不同。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a default <code>ClassEditor</code>, using the thread\ncontext <code>ClassLoader</code>.",
